# Copy to .env and fill in to enable accounts + cross-device progress sync.
# Leave unset and the game runs fine, saving to this browser only.
#
# Both values are PUBLIC — they are inlined into the shipped JavaScript.
# That is safe for Supabase's anon key, which is guarded by row-level security.
# NEVER put a Supabase service_role key or an Anthropic API key here.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Server-side AI (optional) -------------------------------------------
# NOT VITE_ prefixed on purpose: these stay on the server and never reach the
# browser bundle. Set ONE of them in Vercel to give visitors the mentor
# without a key of their own. Leave both unset and visitors can still paste
# their own key, or use the built-in coach.
#
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
